sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Distributed Client
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant L as Leader Node (Node 1)
    participant F as Follower Node (Node 2)
    participant FSM as Replicated FSM

    Note over Client,L: Client holds active lock on "db-migration" with LeaseVersion 1
    
    rect rgb(240, 210, 210)
        Note over L: Crash / Hardware Failure / Network Partition
        L--xGW: Leader Unreachable
        L--xF: Heartbeats cease
    end

    Note over F: Election timer fires on Follower (Node 2)
    F->>F: Elects self as Leader with quorum from Node 3
    Note over F: Node 2 becomes new Raft Leader

    Client->>GW: POST /v1/locks/renew {resource: "db-migration", session_id, lease_version: 1}
    GW->>L: HTTP Forward to old leader (failed connection)
    GW->>GW: Interceptor detects leader failure / stale leader
    GW->>F: GET /v1/cluster/status -> discovers Node 2 is leader
    GW->>F: POST /v1/locks/renew (Retry against Node 2)
    
    F->>FSM: Replicate RenewCommand to Quorum
    FSM-->>F: Command Committed (LeaseVersion 2)
    F-->>GW: HTTP 200 OK (LeaseVersion 2, Expiry extended)
    GW-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (Renewed successfully)
    
    Note over Client,F: Seamless failover completed without lock state corruption

